      },
      {
        "id": "nd_MQGPG3K6D0CFP4E2Z7REV0ZG7F",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 1050,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for an AI cover music visual about music production.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with hard side light with 80 percent of the frame falling into shadow and grade to a clean high-key grade with the whites pushed to the edge of clipping.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
